@startuml Refund Flow
!theme plain
title Stripe Payment - Admin Refund Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Admin as A
participant "OrderRefund\nController" as ORC
participant "ContainerFactory" as CF
participant "StripeAdapterFactory" as SAF
participant "Stripe API" as S
database "Database" as DB

== Phase 1: Load Refund Page ==

A -> ORC: Open Order Details\n(Stripe tab)
activate ORC

ORC -> ORC: render()
ORC -> DB: Load Order by oxid
DB --> ORC: Order object

ORC -> ORC: getStripeApiOrderLastCharge(false)
activate ORC #LightBlue

ORC -> CF: get(StripeAdapterFactoryInterface)
activate CF
CF --> ORC: StripeAdapterFactory
deactivate CF

ORC -> SAF: create(order)
activate SAF
SAF --> ORC: StripeAdapter
deactivate SAF

ORC -> S: paymentIntents.retrieve(pi_xxx)
activate S
S --> ORC: PaymentIntent {\n  latest_charge: ch_xxx\n}
deactivate S

ORC -> S: charges.retrieve(ch_xxx)
activate S
S --> ORC: Charge {\n  amount_captured: 9599,\n  amount_refunded: 0,\n  refunded: false\n}
deactivate S

deactivate ORC

ORC -> ORC: isOrderRefundable()
note right of ORC
  Check:
  - Charge exists?
  - charge.refunded == false?
  - amount_captured > amount_refunded?
end note

ORC -> ORC: getStripeCapturedAmount()
note right of ORC
  amount_captured / 100
  = €95.99
end note

ORC --> A: Render refund form\nwith captured amount
deactivate ORC

== Phase 2: Execute Full Refund ==

A -> ORC: Click "Execute Refund"\n(full refund)
activate ORC

ORC -> ORC: executeFullRefund()
ORC -> ORC: getStripeApiOrderLastCharge(false)

ORC -> S: refunds.create({\n  charge: ch_xxx,\n  amount: 9599\n})
activate S

alt Refund Successful
  S --> ORC: Refund {\n  id: re_xxx,\n  status: 'succeeded',\n  amount: 9599\n}
  deactivate S

  ORC -> DB: Update order refund fields\n(oxstorno, etc.)

  ORC --> A: Success message\n"Refund executed successfully"

else Refund Failed
  S --> ORC: StripeException {\n  code: 'charge_already_refunded',\n  message: '...'\n}

  ORC -> ORC: Set error message
  ORC --> A: Error message\n"Refund failed: ..."
end

deactivate ORC

== Phase 3: Execute Partial Refund ==

A -> ORC: Enter amount €50.00\nClick "Execute Refund"
activate ORC

ORC -> ORC: executePartialRefund(50.00)
ORC -> ORC: Validate amount <= remaining

ORC -> S: refunds.create({\n  charge: ch_xxx,\n  amount: 5000\n})
activate S
S --> ORC: Refund {\n  id: re_xxx,\n  status: 'succeeded',\n  amount: 5000\n}
deactivate S

ORC -> DB: Update order\npartial refund amount

ORC --> A: Success message\n"Partial refund of €50.00"
deactivate ORC

== Error Scenario: API Unavailable ==

A -> ORC: Open refund page
activate ORC

ORC -> ORC: getStripeApiOrderLastCharge(false)
ORC -> CF: get(StripeAdapterFactoryInterface)
activate CF
CF --> ORC: Exception:\n"Service not public"
deactivate CF

ORC -> ORC: stripeApiError = error message
ORC -> ORC: hasStripeApiError() = true

ORC --> A: Show API error box\n(red warning message)
deactivate ORC

note over A, DB #FFEEEE
  **API Error Display:**
  "Stripe API Error: The service has been
  removed or inlined when container compiled..."

  (Instead of misleading "already refunded" message)
end note

== Stripe Charge Status Reference ==

note over S
  **Charge object fields:**

  | Field | Description |
  |-------|-------------|
  | amount | Original charge amount (cents) |
  | amount_captured | Amount captured (cents) |
  | amount_refunded | Total refunded (cents) |
  | refunded | true if fully refunded |

  **Refund status values:**
  - succeeded: Refund completed
  - pending: Refund processing
  - failed: Refund failed
  - canceled: Refund canceled
end note

@enduml
